{"seq":3,"slug":"market-channel-asset-reuse","title":"按市场×渠道的素材复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse","wordCount":2294,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"按市场-渠道的素材复用\">按市场×渠道的素材复用</h1><p>十个市场乘八个渠道等于八十个投放位。如果每个组合都从头生产一份素材，创意产能会在第一周内耗尽；如果一份素材原样推到所有位置，就会出现方图被拉伸成竖版、英文文案出现在日语站点这类事故。复用要解决的核心问题是：<strong>哪些部分可以共享，哪些部分必须重做</strong>，以及这个边界由什么数据决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-复用单元与适配层\">核心概念：复用单元与适配层</h2><p>把素材拆成&quot;共享层&quot;与&quot;适配层&quot;是唯一可行的思路。共享层是跨市场渠道不变的内容——产品本身的形态、品牌色、核心卖点、模特。适配层是因位置而变的部分——画幅与安全区、文案语言、价格与单位、法规要求的元素（如年龄提示、免责声明）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  M[&quot;Master 母版资产&lt;br/&gt;最高分辨率 · 无文字层&quot;] --&gt; C1[&quot;文案层&lt;br/&gt;zh-CN / en-US / ja-JP&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; C2[&quot;画幅层&lt;br/&gt;1:1 / 4:5 / 9:16 / 16:9&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; C3[&quot;法规层&lt;br/&gt;DE 年龄提示 / 免责声明&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; C4[&quot;价格层&lt;br/&gt;货币符号 · 分隔符 · 单位&quot;]&#10;  C1 --&gt; R1[&quot;呈现件&lt;br/&gt;TikTok-MY&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; R1&#10;  C3 --&gt; R1&#10;  C4 --&gt; R1&#10;  C1 --&gt; R2[&quot;呈现件&lt;br/&gt;Meta-DE&quot;]&#10;  C2 --&gt; R2&#10;  C3 --&gt; R2&#10;  C4 --&gt; R2\">graph TD\n  M[\"Master 母版资产&lt;br/&gt;最高分辨率 · 无文字层\"] --&gt; C1[\"文案层&lt;br/&gt;zh-CN / en-US / ja-JP\"]\n  M --&gt; C2[\"画幅层&lt;br/&gt;1:1 / 4:5 / 9:16 / 16:9\"]\n  M --&gt; C3[\"法规层&lt;br/&gt;DE 年龄提示 / 免责声明\"]\n  M --&gt; C4[\"价格层&lt;br/&gt;货币符号 · 分隔符 · 单位\"]\n  C1 --&gt; R1[\"呈现件&lt;br/&gt;TikTok-MY\"]\n  C2 --&gt; R1\n  C3 --&gt; R1\n  C4 --&gt; R1\n  C1 --&gt; R2[\"呈现件&lt;br/&gt;Meta-DE\"]\n  C2 --&gt; R2\n  C3 --&gt; R2\n  C4 --&gt; R2</pre><p>这个模型的关键决策是<strong>母版不承载任何文字与法规元素</strong>。文字一旦烧进母版，任何语言变更都需要重做整张图，复用率会从百分之几十掉到接近零。母版只保留可被程序化的图层（产品或主体的分割蒙版、品牌色区域），文字、价格、角标全部在渲染时合成。这要求母版在入库时携带<strong>分层信息</strong>——要么是 PSD/AI 这类分层源文件，要么是&quot;主体蒙版 + 背景&quot;两张位图加一份图层布局描述。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复用率是可测量的\">复用率是可测量的</h3><p>复用率不是感觉，它有明确定义：<code>复用率 = 1 - 独立生产的内容量 / 总投放内容量</code>。分母是实际投放的呈现件数量，分子是其中的全新创作部分折算成母版当量的数量。这个指标低于 0.6 说明适配层做得不够参数化，团队在重复劳动；高于 0.95 则要警惕——通常意味着适配层被砍得太薄，不同市场的素材看起来完全一样，本地化效果会受损。合理的区间在 0.75 到 0.9。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适配层的参数化\">适配层的参数化</h2><h3 id=\"画幅与安全区\">画幅与安全区</h3><p>画幅适配不是等比缩放。同一个镜头在 9:16 竖版里的构图与 1:1 方版完全不同：产品主体在竖版里应该偏上或偏下留出文字空间，在方版里居中。因此画幅适配需要一个<strong>安全区定义</strong>：每个画幅声明主体必须落在哪个矩形内，以及交互元素（点赞、购买按钮）会遮挡哪些区域。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;tiktok-infeed&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aspect&quot;: &quot;9:16&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pixel&quot;: { &quot;width&quot;: 1080, &quot;height&quot;: 1920 },&#10;  &quot;safeZones&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;bottom-ui&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: 0, &quot;y&quot;: 1460, &quot;w&quot;: 1080, &quot;h&quot;: 460, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;caption-and-cta-overlay&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;top-ui&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: 0, &quot;y&quot;: 0, &quot;w&quot;: 1080, &quot;h&quot;: 240, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;profile-and-nav&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;right-rail&quot;, &quot;x&quot;: 900, &quot;y&quot;: 700, &quot;w&quot;: 180, &quot;h&quot;: 900, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;engagement-buttons&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;subjectBox&quot;: { &quot;x&quot;: 90, &quot;y&quot;: 300, &quot;w&quot;: 900, &quot;h&quot;: 1100 },&#10;  &quot;textMaxChars&quot;: { &quot;headline&quot;: 40, &quot;cta&quot;: 12 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tiktok-infeed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aspect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9:16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pixel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"width\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"height\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"safeZones\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bottom-ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1460</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">460</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"caption-and-cta-overlay\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"top-ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">240</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"profile-and-nav\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"right-rail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">700</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"engagement-buttons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"subjectBox\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"textMaxChars\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"headline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了安全区定义，画幅转换就变成一个几何问题：给定母版的主体蒙版，求一个缩放与平移使得主体落入 <code>subjectBox</code> 且不侵入任何安全区。这个求解在小规模下可以穷举候选缩放比例，取最大化主体面积的解。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文案层的规格约束\">文案层的规格约束</h3><p>文案不是无限长的。每个渠道位置对文案有硬性字符上限，而且不同语言的&quot;同义表达&quot;长度差异巨大——同一句卖点中文 12 字，德语可能 30 字符。这直接决定了文案生成阶段的约束。</p>\n<p>Google 的响应式搜索广告规格是一个有代表性的例子：标题上限 30 字符、描述上限 90 字符，标题最少 3 条最多 15 条，描述最少 2 条最多 4 条；并且明确指出在双宽字符语言（韩文、日文、中文）中每个字符计为 2 个字符 <a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/7684791\">Google Ads RSA specs</a>。最后一条对中文文案的影响是决定性的：30 字符的标题在中文里实际只有 15 个汉字，这与英文 30 个字母的信息量差距很大。适配层必须在文案生成前就知道目标位置使用的是<strong>单宽还是双宽计数</strong>，否则会生成一批看起来合规、推送时被渠道拒绝的文案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置类型</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>上限（单宽）</th>\n<th>中文等效汉字数</th>\n<th>最少条数</th>\n<th>最多条数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RSA 标题</td>\n<td>headline</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RSA 描述</td>\n<td>description</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径文本</td>\n<td>path</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品图主文案</td>\n<td>primary-text</td>\n<td>40（平台各异）</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行动号召</td>\n<td>cta</td>\n<td>12（平台各异）</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"价格与单位的本地化\">价格与单位的本地化</h3><p>价格展示有三个层次的变化：货币换算、格式规则、心理定价惯例。</p>\n<p>格式规则不能靠字符串拼接。ISO 4217 定义货币代码，但符号位置、千分位分隔符、小数位数由地区惯例决定，这些数据在 Unicode CLDR 中有权威定义——CLDR 提供日期时间、数字、货币、度量单位的本地化格式以及复数规则，覆盖 100 多种语言，通常通过 ICU 这类库间接使用 <a href=\"https://cldr.unicode.org/\">Unicode CLDR</a>。直接依赖 CLDR 而不是自建规则表，可以避免&quot;瑞士用点作千分位还是小数位&quot;这类细节错误。</p>\n<p>货币换算涉及汇率时点问题：素材在库里的时间是生成时刻，投放的时间是未来。因此价格层应当支持<strong>占位符</strong>而非具体数字——渲染时注入当时的价格，素材本身不固化金额。这与下一篇 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a> 的&quot;生成物模板化&quot;要求一致：凡是会随时间和市场变化的值，都不应该被烧进素材。</p>\n<h2 id=\"法规层的按市场开关\">法规层的按市场开关</h2><p>不同市场对广告素材有强制性的元素要求。德国的价格标注、法国的环保声明、中东市场的画面内容限制，都是&quot;必须有&quot;或&quot;必须没有&quot;的二元约束。适配层把这些表达成一组<strong>渲染指令</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE market_render_rule (&#10;  rule_id      bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  market       text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel      text,&#10;  placement    text,&#10;  element      text NOT NULL,&#10;  action       text NOT NULL CHECK (action IN (&#39;require&#39;,&#39;forbid&#39;)),&#10;  payload      jsonb NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;{}&#39;::jsonb,&#10;  effective_from date NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   date,&#10;  UNIQUE (market, channel, placement, element, effective_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO market_render_rule (market, channel, placement, element, action, payload, effective_from)&#10;VALUES (&#39;DE&#39;, NULL, NULL, &#39;price-per-unit&#39;, &#39;require&#39;,&#10;        &#39;{&quot;format&quot;:&quot;per-unit&quot;,&quot;basis&quot;:&quot;liter&quot;}&#39;, &#39;2022-05-28&#39;),&#10;       (&#39;DE&#39;, NULL, NULL, &#39;age-gate-18&#39;, &#39;require&#39;,&#10;        &#39;{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;bottom-band&quot;,&quot;minHeightPx&quot;:60}&#39;, &#39;2024-01-01&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> market_render_rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  placement    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  element      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'require'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forbid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payload      jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (market, channel, placement, element, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market_render_rule (market, channel, placement, element, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, payload, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'price-per-unit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'require'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '{\"format\":\"per-unit\",\"basis\":\"liter\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2022-05-28'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'age-gate-18'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'require'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        '{\"style\":\"bottom-band\",\"minHeightPx\":60}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>channel</code> 与 <code>placement</code> 可为 NULL 表示&quot;该市场内所有渠道&quot;。规则带生效期是因为法规会变，历史素材的重渲染需要按当时生效的规则集，而不是当前规则集。这一点与 <a href=\"../creative-approval-flow/ad-claim-brand-compliance\">广告宣称/品牌合规校验</a> 里审批实例的规则快照是同一个设计动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排产-从复用单元到呈现件任务\">排产：从复用单元到呈现件任务</h2><p>复用的最后一个环节是决定&quot;这次要生成哪些呈现件&quot;。给定一次投放的（市场 × 渠道 × 版式 × 语言）组合，排产的任务是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对每个组合，从素材库检索候选母版（按标签与效果分排序）。</li>\n<li>检查候选母版的授权是否覆盖该市场与渠道（见 <a href=\"asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a>）。</li>\n<li>对通过校验的组合，检查是否已有现成呈现件（缓存命中）。</li>\n<li>未命中的生成渲染任务，写入队列。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第三步的缓存命中判定必须包含渲染输入的全量指纹，而不只是资产 ID：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE rendition (&#10;  rendition_id  bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  asset_id      bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  version_id    bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  placement     text   NOT NULL,&#10;  market        text   NOT NULL,&#10;  locale        text   NOT NULL,&#10;  input_digest  text   NOT NULL,&#10;  object_key    text   NOT NULL,&#10;  bytes         bigint NOT NULL,&#10;  built_at      timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (version_id, placement, market, locale, input_digest)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX rendition_lookup&#10;  ON rendition (version_id, placement, market, locale);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rendition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rendition_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asset_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  placement     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locale        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  input_digest  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  object_key    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bytes         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  built_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (version_id, placement, market, locale, input_digest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rendition_lookup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rendition (version_id, placement, market, locale);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>input_digest</code> 是母版文件哈希、文案文本、价格占位符版本、市场渲染规则版本的联合哈希。任一输入变化都会产生新的 digest，从而自然生成新呈现件而不覆盖旧的——旧呈现件可能仍在生效的投放中使用，覆盖它是危险的。这条唯一键同时充当幂等键：并发的重复渲染请求只会有一行落库。</p>\n<p>排产的一个工程要点是<strong>优先级</strong>。大促临近时，高消耗位置的呈现件应当先于长尾位置生成。优先级可以简单地由&quot;该位置的历史消耗 / 生成成本&quot;给出，而不必引入复杂的调度器。第 4 章的 <a href=\"../creative-performance-loop/creative-cost-scale-metric\">创意生产成本与规模化指标</a> 会用到同样的比值来说明规模化的瓶颈在哪。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排产的输入与输出契约\">排产的输入与输出契约</h3><p>排产器应当是纯函数，输入是一次投放的位置清单与素材候选集，输出是待生成的呈现件任务清单。纯函数意味着同样的输入必然产生同样的任务集，这让&quot;重跑排产&quot;成为安全的操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;planId&quot;: &quot;cmp-2026-q4-my-launch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;targets&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;market&quot;: &quot;MY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;tiktok&quot;,&#10;      &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;9:16&quot;,&#10;      &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;ms-MY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;masterAssetId&quot;: 88012,&#10;      &quot;masterVersionId&quot;: 55120,&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: 0.82&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;market&quot;: &quot;MY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;meta-feed&quot;,&#10;      &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;1:1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;ms-MY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;masterAssetId&quot;: 88012,&#10;      &quot;masterVersionId&quot;: 55120,&#10;      &quot;priority&quot;: 0.61&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;excluded&quot;: [{ &quot;market&quot;: &quot;SG&quot;, &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;tiktok&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;rights_not_covering_market&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;budget&quot;: { &quot;maxTasks&quot;: 400, &quot;maxEstimatedCostMicros&quot;: 12000000 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"planId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cmp-2026-q4-my-launch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tiktok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9:16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ms-MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"masterAssetId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88012</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"masterVersionId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.82</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"meta-feed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1:1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ms-MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"masterAssetId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88012</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"masterVersionId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.61</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"excluded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tiktok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rights_not_covering_market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxTasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxEstimatedCostMicros\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>excluded</code> 列表是输出的一部分，而不是被丢弃的信息。运营最常问的问题是&quot;为什么这个市场没有素材&quot;，如果排产器只返回通过的位置，这个问题的答案就只能靠人工比对。把排除原因显式返回，让排产的决策过程可解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复用靠共享层与适配层的分层：母版不含文字、价格与法规元素，全部在渲染时合成。</li>\n<li>复用率 = 1 - 独立生产量/总投放量，合理区间 0.75–0.9，过低说明参数化不足，过高说明本地化被牺牲。</li>\n<li>画幅适配是几何问题，靠安全区定义求解主体布局，不是等比缩放。</li>\n<li>文案规格必须区分单宽与双宽计数；中文在双宽计数下可用信息量约为英文的一半。</li>\n<li>价格格式依赖 CLDR 而非自建规则；金额用占位符，渲染时注入。</li>\n<li>市场渲染规则带生效期，支持历史素材按当时规则重渲染。</li>\n<li>呈现件用输入指纹做唯一键，兼作幂等键，且不覆盖旧呈现件。</li>\n<li>资产模型见 <a href=\"creative-asset-library-tag\">素材库模型与多维标签</a>；排产生成的实际执行见 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按市场×渠道的素材复用","id":"按市场-渠道的素材复用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：复用单元与适配层","id":"核心概念-复用单元与适配层"},{"level":3,"text":"复用率是可测量的","id":"复用率是可测量的"},{"level":2,"text":"适配层的参数化","id":"适配层的参数化"},{"level":3,"text":"画幅与安全区","id":"画幅与安全区"},{"level":3,"text":"文案层的规格约束","id":"文案层的规格约束"},{"level":3,"text":"价格与单位的本地化","id":"价格与单位的本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"法规层的按市场开关","id":"法规层的按市场开关"},{"level":2,"text":"排产：从复用单元到呈现件任务","id":"排产-从复用单元到呈现件任务"},{"level":3,"text":"排产的输入与输出契约","id":"排产的输入与输出契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"版本/版权/授权有效期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license"},"next":{"title":"AI 文案/图/视频批量生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen"}}